Query:
--Description: 8) Examine positional consistency of the first two components
--             (x and y) of "ImagePositionPatient" for each CT series.
--             Instead of filtering with a HAVING clause (which could yield
--             no rows) we compute “distinct_x” and “distinct_y”, then
--             derive a simple variation score that lets us see which series
--             violate the “all slices share same x,y” rule.  A score of 0
--             means perfect consistency.
SELECT
